SystemName QRAFT M8-B fcc Fe nonparallel initialization
SystemLabel m8b_fcc_nonparallel
NumberOfAtoms 2
NumberOfSpecies 1
LatticeConstant 1 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
0.000000000 3.590000000 3.590000000
1.795000000 0.000000000 1.795000000
1.795000000 1.795000000 0.000000000
%endblock LatticeVectors
%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1 26 Fe
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel
AtomicCoordinatesFormat Ang
%block AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
 0.000000000 0.000000000 0.000000000 1
 0.000000000 1.795000000 1.795000000 1
%endblock AtomicCoordinatesAndAtomicSpecies
XC.Functional GGA
XC.Authors PBE
PAO.BasisSize SZ
PAO.EnergyShift 50 meV
Mesh.Cutoff 150 Ry
ElectronicTemperature 300 K
MaxSCFIterations 160
DM.MixingWeight 0.05
DM.NumberPulay 8
DM.Tolerance 0.0001
DM.UseSaveDM true
Spin non-colinear
